          {
            "title": "Element",
            "id": 79840,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listenin içindeki değerler veya verilere <strong>öğe</strong> denir. <code>\"Read\"</code>, <code>\"Workout\"</code> ve <code>\"Code\"</code> bu listenin öğeleridir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Read&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Workout&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Code&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"todo\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Read', 'Workout', 'Code']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Code\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listenin içindeki değerler veya verilere <strong>öğe</strong> denir. <code>\"Read\"</code>, <code>\"Workout\"</code> ve <code>\"Code\"</code> bu listenin öğeleridir.</p><p>Listenin <code>['Read', 'Workout', 'Code']</code> yazdırması için son iki öğeyi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Read&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Workout&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Code&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"todo\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Code\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Read', 'Workout', 'Code']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Workout\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Code\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
